golangci-lint patch carried by Speakeasy until upstream ships an equivalent fix.

Upstream: https://github.com/golangci/golangci-lint/issues/6822
Applies to: golangci-lint v2.15.0 (server/gcl/version), on top of
0001-guard-facts-debug-calls.patch.

Stops copying every dependency's facts into each package's fact maps. A fact
lookup goes to the action of the package that produced the fact instead, so
facts are stored once rather than once per dependent package.

This is a prototype: it is larger than the other patches and has had less
review. If lint findings ever differ from a build without it, remove it
first.

Remove when: golangci-lint stops copying inherited facts, or this patch stops
applying after an upgrade. It can be removed on its own.

